WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:04,630
I started the fire

2
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:07,190
Zhou Ting, Fang Xiaoman and I are familiar with each other and eat big portions

3
00:00:07,630 --> 00:00:14,830
The rest are a bunch of people. Thank you, Sister Weiwei. That’s all.

4
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:17,890
How much did you dig back today?

5
00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:19,250
I have no idea

6
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:21,450
Eat big portions with your mouth

7
00:00:21,650 --> 00:00:27,390
I'll tell you what you said when you were running around drinking Northwest Linnuo.

8
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:44,810
Sister Weiwei’s fair share makes my feet sore and not cold.

9
00:00:44,930 --> 00:00:45,970
Not even a mouthful of hot water

10
00:00:47,330 --> 00:01:03,620
Chai Quan is wet. Water cannot be boiled. What smells like oil?

11
00:01:04,220 --> 00:01:05,380
Oil coming out of barbecue

12
00:01:12,170 --> 00:01:13,250
It eats alone

13
00:01:13,810 --> 00:01:15,410
More than all of us combined

14
00:01:15,810 --> 00:02:28,740
Three days ago, I boiled water for them and they thought I was in the way.

15
00:02:28,900 --> 00:02:31,420
Now they are willing to eat sour fruit and I eat fish

16
00:02:45,030 --> 00:02:46,310
I didn’t expect to eat less.

17
00:02:46,590 --> 00:02:47,700
Why are you doing this this morning?

18
00:02:47,700 --> 00:02:48,620
As many as those with empty hands

19
00:03:11,150 --> 00:03:12,670
Wild ginger is edible

20
00:03:13,940 --> 00:03:15,780
Yancoin grapes can be eaten directly

21
00:03:16,020 --> 00:03:17,020
Fish can also be used to make wine

22
00:03:17,660 --> 00:03:18,660
Active mountain spring water

23
00:03:18,780 --> 00:03:20,540
It is safe to drink and can be consumed directly.

24
00:03:20,940 --> 00:03:32,820
Waterman gets it done
